  <History Date="29-12-25" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (it is not clear whether the all of the colour components are intended to be controlled as a single mixing system or separated into RGB, WW and CW elements.  The mapping for the 244 channel mode suggests separate but all of the other modes suggest one model.  this is strange and confusing)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="07-01-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Updated in line with latest charts in response to manufacturer request (adds crossfade control)" Version="1" />
  <History Date="24-07-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from ACME PIXEL LINE SLIM (SL 100 IP)" Version="2" />
  <History Date="25-07-26" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." Version="3" />
